  m_name: The Drowned
  m_entryIndex: 1
  m_fullBodyIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3aabdb1e29071674c867c301e23785f0, type: 3}
  m_description: 'Once sailors, the Drowned are corpses dragged back from the ocean
    floor. Their swollen, blue-gray bodies are covered in barnacles and seaweed,
    while seawater constantly pours from their open mouths. They wield broken anchors
    and hunt by dragging victims into the sea.


    They are weakened by fire and
    sunlight, and severe wounds to the chest can bring them down quickly.'
